msgid "A complete digital learning environment for schools, academies, and universities."
msgstr "Një mjedis i plotë i mësimit dixhital për shkollat, akademitë dhe universitetet."

msgid "A compose deploy reads ``schema_migrations`` of an existing database before the pinned image starts. The newest aggregated migration ``1000NNN`` marks a schema migrated by major NNN + 1; without one, ``20241015081341`` marks 15 and anything older counts as 14. For every major between that stage and the pinned ``services.web.version``, the deploy stops the old app containers, runs the seeder of ``openproject/openproject:<major>`` and works off the queued GoodJob jobs with `drain_jobs.rb <./files/ruby/drain_jobs.rb>`__, then starts the pinned major. A database migrated by a newer major than the pinned one stops the deploy. Swarm deploys skip the stepping, so the pinned seeder reports an incompatible schema itself."
msgstr ""

msgid "A compose deploy reads `schema_migrations` of an existing database before the pinned image starts. The newest aggregated migration `1000NNN` marks a schema migrated by major NNN + 1; without one, `20241015081341` marks 15 and anything older counts as 14. For every major between that stage and the pinned `services.web.version`, the deploy stops the old app containers, runs the seeder of `openproject/openproject:<major>` and works off the queued GoodJob jobs with [drain_jobs.rb](./files/ruby/drain_jobs.rb), then starts the pinned major. A database migrated by a newer major than the pinned one stops the deploy. Swarm deploys skip the stepping, so the pinned seeder reports an incompatible schema itself."
