msgid "A role MAY omit the file entirely. The loader then exposes exactly one variant equal to the assembled per-role meta payload (`meta/services.yml` + `meta/server.yml` + `meta/rbac.yml` + `meta/volumes.yml` + `apply_schema()`'d `meta/secrets.yml`) unchanged."
msgstr "Një rol që MAJ e ka hequr krejt file. Ngarkuesi pastaj ekspozon pikërisht një variant të barabartë me pagën e mbledhur për-role meta (`meta/services.yml` + `meta/server.yml` + `meta/rbac.yml` + `meta/volumes.yml` + `apply_schema()`'d `meta/secrets.yml`) I pandryshuar."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A role MAY ship `templates/design.js`, or `templates/design.js.j2` when it needs Jinja. `sys-front-inj-design` carries the per-app config `{logo, title, urls}` in the script tag's `data-design` attribute and prepends a line that reads it into `INFINITO_DESIGN`, collapses the result, adds its CSP hash and injects it whenever `services.design.enabled` is enabled, independent of `services.javascript.enabled`. The config rides in the attribute because CSP hashes only the script body: an onion vhost rewrites the CDN host in the payload, and a body holding that host would no longer match its hash. For the same reason a design script MUST read branding through `INFINITO_DESIGN` and MUST NOT interpolate `design.urls` itself."
