# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Admission is not declared here. A client marks itself once, in its own ``meta/services.yml`` self-entry, as ``mcp_consumer: true``; a provider deviates by carrying ``mcp_consumer: false`` on that client's entry in its own ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` resolves the pair."
msgstr "Pranimi nuk është deklaruar këtu. Një klient shënon veten një herë, në vetvete ``meta/services.yml`` Vetë-hyrja, si ``mcp_consumer: true``; Një furnizues devijon duke mbajtur ``mcp_consumer: false`` me hyrjen e atij klienti në vetë ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` E zgjidh çiftin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Admission lives in `meta/services.yml`, not here. A client sets `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` in its own role; a provider refuses one by setting `mcp_consumer: false` on that client's entry. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) requires every provider to carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated entry for every declared client, so a round plans provider and client together."
msgstr "Pranimi jeton brenda `meta/services.yml`- Jo këtu. Një set klienti `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` në rolin e vet; një furnizues refuzon një duke vendosur `mcp_consumer: false` në hyrjen e atij klienti. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) Kërkon që çdo furnizues të mbajë një `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-një hyrje për çdo klient të deklaruar, kështu që një ofrues plani dhe klient së bashku."

