msgid "Baserow’s native ``openid_connect`` auth provider belongs to the bundled enterprise plugin and refuses to register without a paid Baserow Enterprise licence, so the addon ships declared and off and the oauth2-proxy front door above stays the supported SSO path. An operator holding that licence switches the addon on; `files/playwright/addons/openid_connect.spec.js <./files/playwright/addons/openid_connect.spec.js>`__ then asserts the provider is registered and offered on the login page."
