msgstr "Ata janë mbrojtës të mrekullueshëm."

msgid "Both hold an exclusive lock under the work directory, so two of them on one checkout never interleave, and clear what an interrupted run left there. They swap entries by rename and delete the old copies only after the swap, so an interrupt never leaves a declared role missing."
