msgid "Every deploy verifies the resulting credentials through `/api/auth/login` and the authenticated `/api/auth/me`, then removes the temporary session. Rejected logins fail the deploy even if the container is healthy. Credentials travel on standard input to an unconditionally masked task; only a fixed success/failure message is shown. Reconciliation runs in a separate Node process, so it opens the running database through the image's internal `db/index.js` `connectDb` export before using the auth service exports; both must be checked when changing the image version. Under **Keys**, copy the unified API key for clients. Model availability depends on your configured providers and their quotas; deploying this role does not supply provider accounts or bypass their limits."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every deploy verifies the resulting credentials through ``/api/auth/login`` and the authenticated ``/api/auth/me``, then removes the temporary session. Rejected logins fail the deploy even if the container is healthy. Credentials travel on standard input to an unconditionally masked task; only a fixed success/failure message is shown. Reconciliation runs in a separate Node process, so it opens the running database through the image’s internal ``db/index.js`` ``connectDb`` export before using the auth service exports; both must be checked when changing the image version. Under **Keys**, copy the unified API key for clients. Model availability depends on your configured providers and their quotas; deploying this role does not supply provider accounts or bypass their limits."
