msgid "N (D24, D28): `make runner-count` prints the default N and every term: `min(RAM / ram_per_deploy, CPUs / cpus_per_deploy, (free disk - growth - floor) / disk_per_deploy)`, rounded down, at least 1, where `growth` is the sum over the caches of `max(0, cap - current use)`. Bytes a cache already holds are not free disk, so they are not subtracted a second time. The per-deploy budgets come from a checked-in calibration file that records the measured full deploy (applications, commit, date, peak memory, CPU, disk growth). `INFINITO_RUNNER_COUNT` (new) overrides N."
