msgid "On a fresh instance the object icons `agent-portal-logo` and `agent-portal-icon` do not exist: before the design import the sign-in page and the header served `/static/img/kix_default.png` as logo and favicon, the fallback of the frontend. The backend console offers `Admin::ObjectIcon::Import` and `Admin::ObjectIcon::SyncAllToFS` only, so `tasks/02_design.yml` can write an icon but not delete one. With `design` switched off again the role therefore imports the images the frontend ships as its seed (`/opt/kix/static/img/kix_start.png`, `kix_start_icon.png`) over the icons it marked, instead of returning to the state without icons. Options: delete the two icons through the backend's Perl API (`Kernel::System::ObjectIcon`) in that case; or keep the seed images."
