# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Python source patterns. Dependency declarations MUST live under [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML/Jinja patterns MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Testet në këtë directory MUST mbulojnë vetëm modelet burimore python. Deklaratat e varësisë jetojnë nën MUST [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YaML/Jinja Modele MUST jetojnë nën [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

