msgstr "E njëjta string `.env` bart ``INFINITO_CACHE_UPSTREAMS``, pra detyra e kapsit të rolit dhe dexbuck caktuar Nesus nga një përkthim. `utils.cache.records` e zotëron formatin."

msgid "The same task renders each setting value into the `shell:` heredoc, so the SMTP password, the OIDC client secret, the hCaptcha secret and the S3 secret key travel in the `bash -c` argv; `no_log` follows `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`, which local deploys disable. Option: send the SQL on `stdin:` to `LISTMONK_EXEC_DATABASE`, as the administrator password task does."
