msgid "This Ansible role installs the [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the [AUR (Arch User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."
msgstr "Ky rol i dukshëm instalon rolin [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) Klient desktopi në sistemet Arch Linux duke përdorur këtë [AUR (Arç User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."

