# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon dhe mban shërbimin Docker, përfshirë Docker ComposeNë sistemet Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems.   It is part of the [Infinito.Nexus Project](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), maintained and developed by [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon dhe mban shërbimin Docker, përfshirë Docker ComposeNë sistemet Linux. Është pjesë e... [Infinito.Nexus Projekti](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), mirëmbajtur dhe zhvilluar nga [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and runs the **cleanback** tool to automatically detect and remove **failed Docker backups**."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon dhe funksionon **Pastro** Instrument për të zbuluar dhe hequr automatikisht **Docker**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs caffeine-ng and configures it to autostart for preventing screen sleep on GNOME."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon kafeinë-ng dhe e konfiguron atë për të filluar autostartin për parandalimin e gjumit në ekran në GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs distro-specific equivalents of core build tooling so systems are ready for compiling software from source. After deploying this role, all common build dependencies are available on the system."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon ekuivalente distro-fidenciale të ndërtimit bazë, kështu që sistemet janë gati për hartimin e programeve kompjuterike nga burimi. Pas vendosjes së këtij roli, të gjitha vartësitë e përbashkëta të ndërtimit janë në dispozicion në sistem."

msgid "This role installs one PHP ini (`FILE_PHP_HARDENING_INI`), one interim PHP ini (`FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI`) and one PHP-FPM pool drop-in (`FILE_PHP_FPM_HARDENING_CONF`). A PHP role opts in by declaring a `type: config` entry with that file as `source` and a file inside the scan dir of its image as `target`, e.g. `conf.d/zz-infinito-hardening.ini` or, for the pool, `php-fpm.d/zz-infinito-hardening.conf`. Only roles whose image still ships a PHP release without the CVE-2026-109618 fix also mount `FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI`, as `conf.d/zz-infinito-memory-unlimited.ini`."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs one PHP ini (``FILE_PHP_HARDENING_INI``), one interim PHP ini (``FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI``) and one PHP-FPM pool drop-in (``FILE_PHP_FPM_HARDENING_CONF``). A PHP role opts in by declaring a ``type: config`` entry with that file as ``source`` and a file inside the scan dir of its image as ``target``, e.g. ``conf.d/zz-infinito-hardening.ini`` or, for the pool, ``php-fpm.d/zz-infinito-hardening.conf``. Only roles whose image still ships a PHP release without the CVE-2026-109618 fix also mount ``FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI``, as ``conf.d/zz-infinito-memory-unlimited.ini``."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon ose përmirëson një paketë python **sistemi** sistemi ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``)- Ajo është menduar për mjetet CLI që duhet të jenë në dispozicion globalisht (e.g., shërbimet e mirëmbajtjes)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon ose përmirëson një paketë python **sistemi** sistemi `pip` (`python3 -m pip`)- Ajo është menduar për mjetet CLI që duhet të jenë në dispozicion globalisht (e.g., shërbimet e mirëmbajtjes)."

msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the KeePassXC desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It is intended for personal-workstation roles in the desktop tier and does not configure databases, browser integrations, or autofill helpers."
msgstr "Roli KeePassXC Program desktopi mbi funksionimin me bazë në Pacman nëpërmjet menazhuesit të paketave të sistemit. Ajo synon rolet e punës personale në tirin e desktopit dhe nuk konfiguron bazat e të dhënave, integrimin e shfletuesit apo ndihmësit e automulimit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager in a **secure, reproducible, and idempotent** way across multiple Linux distributions."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon menazhuesin e paketave Nix në një **të sigurtë, të ashpër dhe të padepërtueshëm** Përmes shumë shpërndarjes së Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager via pacman on Arch x86_64 or via the official installer with SHA256 verification."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon menazhuesin e paketave Nix nëpërmjet pacman në Arç x86_64 ose nëpërmjet instalimit zyrtar me SHA256 Vërtetim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the OBS Studio desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It targets the desktop tier and does not configure scenes, capture devices, or streaming profiles."
msgstr "Roli OBS Studio Program desktopi mbi funksionimin me bazë në Pacman nëpërmjet menazhuesit të paketave të sistemit. Ai synon tirin e desktopit dhe nuk konfiguron skena, pajisje për të kapur ose profile të reja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the SSH client packages required to enable secure remote access and key-based authentication on Linux systems. It ensures that the appropriate SSH client is installed depending on the target distribution and that the installation is executed only once."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon paketat e klientit SSH që kërkohen për të mundësuar hyrjen në distancë dhe autentifikimin me bazë kyçe në sistemet Linux. Ai siguron se klienti i përshtatshëm SSH është instaluar në varësi të shpërndarjes së objektivit dhe se instalimi ekzekutohet vetëm një herë."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Roli [Pthon-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) Pakoja në sistemin objektiv. Ai siguron që menaxheri i paketës së pip është në dispozicion për instalimin e paketave python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from `/etc/sudoers.d`."
msgstr "Roli [Sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) Paketa dhe vendos një dosje të parazgjedhur për të siguruar përshkallëzim të sigurtë dhe të vazhdueshëm të privilegjit në sistemin objektiv. Ai përdor një file të parakonfiguruar që ndjek praktikat më të mira dhe përfshin direktiva për të lexuar skedarët prej `/etc/sudoers.d`."

msgid "This role installs the ``app-control`` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy ``web-app-semaphore``, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. ``sys-svc-compose`` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in ``sys-front-inj-all`` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the ``baudolo`` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, which they include conditionally once ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` is in ``group_names``. The first seed of a play reads ``databases.csv`` once through ``tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml``; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips ``baudolo-seed``, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. ``baudolo-seed`` gets the password on stdin (``--password-stdin``), so it never shows in the host’s process list."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `app-control` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy `web-app-semaphore`, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. `sys-svc-compose` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in `sys-front-inj-all` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `baudolo` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, which they include conditionally once `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is in `group_names`. The first seed of a play reads `databases.csv` once through `tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml`; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips `baudolo-seed`, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. `baudolo-seed` gets the password on stdin (`--password-stdin`), so it never shows in the host's process list."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Roli `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ Pakoja në sistemin objektiv. Ai siguron që menaxheri i paketës së pip është në dispozicion për instalimin e paketave python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Roli `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ Paketa dhe vendos një dosje të parazgjedhur për të siguruar përshkallëzim të sigurtë dhe të vazhdueshëm të privilegjit në sistemin objektiv. Ai përdor një file të parakonfiguruar që ndjek praktikat më të mira dhe përfshin direktiva për të lexuar skedarët prej ``/etc/sudoers.d``."

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/), up to `SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES`. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__, up to ``SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES``. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon paketat e papërshtatëshme të klientit NFS në çdo host në grupin Ansible ``svc-swarm-node`` Edhe ata që fort konkurojnë, ``storage.nfs.server`` dhe baza e eksportit nga svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT-i do të konfirmojë akomodueshmërinë dhe qëndrueshmërinë në kohën e caktuar. Volumi i dockerit ndodh më vonë, i drejtuar nga motori Docker në fillim të kontejnerit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Ky rol instalon paketat e papërshtatëshme të klientit NFS në çdo host në grupin Ansible `svc-swarm-node` Edhe ata që fort konkurojnë, `storage.nfs.server` dhe baza e eksportit nga svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT-i do të konfirmojë akomodueshmërinë dhe qëndrueshmërinë në kohën e caktuar. Volumi i dockerit ndodh më vonë, i drejtuar nga motori Docker në fillim të kontejnerit."

msgid "This role installs the pinned `@openai/codex` CLI on a workstation and manages the connection shared by the CLI and the Codex editor extension in `~/.codex/config.toml`. The `codex-mode` switch it installs selects either the platform's model gateway or the user's own ChatGPT subscription."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the pinned ``@openai/codex`` CLI on a workstation and manages the connection shared by the CLI and the Codex editor extension in ``~/.codex/config.toml``. The ``codex-mode`` switch it installs selects either the platform’s model gateway or the user’s own ChatGPT subscription."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Është a nga ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-Shkëlqyeshëm në listë (``action``. ``uuid``. ``url``) Të konsumuar nga ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. S'ka asnjë zgjatje konkrete dhe nuk lexon. ``meta/addons/`` Dosjet. Role që drejtojnë shtesat konkrete të GNOME, si për shembull `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, deklaroji ato nëpërmjet kontratës së shtuar të unifikuar ``meta/addons/`` (kërkesë 026), me një file shtesë (``mechanism: extension``. ``source: upstream``. ``config: { uuid, url }``); shiko atë rol për shembullin e për-file."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by `services.gnome-extensions.plugins`, a 3-tuple list (`action`, `uuid`, `url`) consumed by `cli-gnome-extension-manager`. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no `meta/addons/` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as [dsk-gnome](../dsk-gnome/), declare them through the unified addon contract under `meta/addons/` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (`mechanism: extension`, `source: upstream`, `config: { uuid, url }`); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Është a nga `services.gnome-extensions.plugins`, a 3-Shkëlqyeshëm në listë (`action`. `uuid`. `url`) Të konsumuar nga `cli-gnome-extension-manager`. S'ka asnjë zgjatje konkrete dhe nuk lexon. `meta/addons/` Dosjet. Role që drejtojnë shtesat konkrete të GNOME, si për shembull [dsk-gnome](../dsk-gnome/), deklaroji ato nëpërmjet kontratës së shtuar të unifikuar `meta/addons/` (kërkesë 026), me një file shtesë (`mechanism: extension`. `source: upstream`. `config: { uuid, url }`); shiko atë rol për shembullin e për-file."

# kështu që inventari i projektit pranon `svc-swarm-manager` si i ligjshëm
