# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions the isolating runtime layer of a container host. It installs the pinned gVisor binary, then re-runs the daemon configuration of the container role so the freshly installed runtime is registered and the daemon is restarted onto it. In swarm mode it additionally labels the node as sandbox-isolating, which is the placement constraint that keeps sandboxed workloads off nodes that still default to the shared kernel."
msgstr "Ky rol siguron shtresën e një mbajtësi kontenieri në kohën e izolimit. Instalon binarin gVisor të bllokuar, pastaj riorganizon konfigurimin e daemon të rolit të konteinerit në mënyrë që të regjistrohet koha e riinstaluar dhe daemon të riniset në të. Në modalitetin mizëri ai etiketon më tej nyjën si kuti ranore-izoluese, që është pengesa e vendosjes që mban ngarkesat e punës me kuti rëre jashtë nyjeve që ende duhet të përdoren për kokrrat e ndara."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions:"
msgstr "Ky rol siguron:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role publishes the Infinito.Nexus documentation for the latest commit and for every release tag. It builds the repository's Markdown, reStructuredText and role READMEs into an HTML site with [Sphinx](https://www.sphinx-doc.org/) and the [Awesome Sphinx Theme](https://sphinxawesome.xyz/). There is no database."
msgstr "Ky rol publikon Infinito.Nexus Dokumentim për listën e fundit dhe për çdo etiketë. Ajo ndërton Markdown e magazinës, retructuredTekst dhe role LEXMEs në një faqe HTML me [Spinx](https://www.sphinx-doc.org/) dhe [Spinks fantastik Tema](https://sphinxawesome.xyz/)- Nuk ka databazë."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role publishes the Infinito.Nexus documentation for the latest commit and for every release tag. It builds the repository’s Markdown, reStructuredText and role READMEs into an HTML site with `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org/>`__ and the `Awesome Sphinx Theme <https://sphinxawesome.xyz/>`__. There is no database."
msgstr "Ky rol publikon Infinito.Nexus Dokumentim për listën e fundit dhe për çdo etiketë. Ai ndërton depon e tijë Markdown, restructuredTekst dhe role LEXMEs në një faqe HTML me `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org/>`__ dhe `Awesome Sphinx Theme <https://sphinxawesome.xyz/>`__- Nuk ka databazë."

msgid "This role puts WireGuard under a swarm deployment so that swarm control, overlay and storage traffic never crosses an untunnelled network. It configures the hub-and-spoke meshes the deployment declares, any number of them, with the swarm manager as the hub of each. The manager forwards between them, which is how a worker reaches an NFS export it is not a member of."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role re-invokes each deployed MCP client's own reconciliation from the complete provider set."
msgstr "Ky rol rithirr pajtimin e çdo klienti të vendosur MCP nga seti i plotë i ofruesit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role re-invokes each deployed MCP client’s own reconciliation from the complete provider set."
msgstr "Ky rol rithirr çdo klient të vendosur MCP-së për pajtimin e tij nga seti i plotë i ofruesit."

msgid "This role refreshes the package index and upgrades every installed package on the host. ``tasks/main.yml`` reads ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` and dispatches to one task file per package-manager family. Debian and Ubuntu both use ``apt``, so they share a single task file; Fedora and CentOS both use ``dnf``, and CentOS reaches ``fedora.yml`` through ``centos.yml``. A separate ``unsupported.yml`` fails loudly with a clear message when a host runs a distribution that this role does not yet cover."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role refreshes the package index and upgrades every installed package on the host. `tasks/main.yml` reads `ansible_facts['distribution']` and dispatches to one task file per package-manager family. Debian and Ubuntu both use `apt`, so they share a single task file; Fedora and CentOS both use `dnf`, and CentOS reaches `fedora.yml` through `centos.yml`. A separate `unsupported.yml` fails loudly with a clear message when a host runs a distribution that this role does not yet cover."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role replaces the end-of-life [`web-app-mailu`](../web-app-mailu/) role. Applications send mail through the same provider-agnostic abstraction (`lookup('email')` / [`sys-svc-mail`](../sys-svc-mail/)) — no consumer changes are needed beyond the provider repoint."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role replaces the end-of-life ```web-app-mailu`` <../web-app-mailu/>`__ role. Applications send mail through the same provider-agnostic abstraction (``lookup('email')`` / ```sys-svc-mail`` <../sys-svc-mail/>`__) — no consumer changes are needed beyond the provider repoint."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role runs Proxmox VE as one Docker container, in a data center or locally, as the hypervisor for agent VM workspaces. It builds its own image from the official Debian base and the official ``pve-no-subscription`` repository at the pinned ``services.proxmox.ve.version``, uses no third-party image and changes nothing about the subscription notice. The web UI is served at its own domain through the front proxy, and the agent broker (``svc-ai-agent-broker``) drives the agent VMs through a pool-scoped API token over the internal address."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role runs Proxmox VE as one Docker container, in a data center or locally, as the hypervisor for agent VM workspaces. It builds its own image from the official Debian base and the official `pve-no-subscription` repository at the pinned `services.proxmox.ve.version`, uses no third-party image and changes nothing about the subscription notice. The web UI is served at its own domain through the front proxy, and the agent broker (`svc-ai-agent-broker`) drives the agent VMs through a pool-scoped API token over the internal address."
msgstr ""

