msgid "Under compose the gateway of the application's own network and of every network it joins: the proxy runs on the host network and reaches a published port, which Docker forwards from the gateway of whichever of those networks it routes the container through. Under swarm the subnets of the overlays the application shares with the proxy, which reaches it from its task address there."
