msgid "[pull.sh](files/pull.sh) runs `docker pull` for every image, also for one the host already has, and touches no container. A failed pull is retried three times, ten seconds apart, and an attempt that runs longer than an hour, scaled by `TIMEOUT_FACTOR`, fails without a retry. The play ends with the images pulled, the images whose pull changed nothing, the images the roles build, and every image whose pull still failed with the registry's error. One failed image fails the play, so `failed=0` means every listed image is present on the host."
