msgid "`git fetch` and `git ls-remote` over SSH need `ssh(1)` to read `~/.ssh/known_hosts` and `~/.ssh/config`. With the whole directory in `denyRead`, `ssh` fails with `Host key verification failed`. `denyRead` therefore lists only the default private key files, and `ssh` authenticates through the agent socket named in `SSH_AUTH_SOCK`, which `allowAllUnixSockets: true` keeps reachable. `Bash(git push*)` is in `deny`, so pushes stay with the operator."
